  "body": "Some opportunities come around once in a generation. After 25 years of ownership, our vendors are ready to move on, offering developers the chance to shape the next chapter of this tightly held Rangi zone address.\r\n\r\nTucked away in a quiet cul-de-sac, this 668sqm freehold site sits within the Mixed Housing Suburban zone, with both stormwater and wastewater services on-site. The existing 290sqm home is being sold \"as is, where is,\" and the opportunity lies in what comes next.\r\n\r\nAUCTION: Thursday, 17th December 2026 from 5pm at Ray White Milford (unless sold prior)\r\nINFO: https://rwmilford.co.nz/MFD30251 (please contact agents for full information pack)\r\n\r\nVIEWINGS BY APPOINTMENT ONLY\r\n\r\nFEATURES YOU'LL LOVE\r\n* First time on the market in 25 years\r\n* 668sqm freehold development site (more or less)\r\n* Mixed Housing Suburban zoning under AUP\r\n* Stormwater and wastewater services on-site\r\n* Generous road frontage\r\n* Existing 290sqm home sold \"as is, where is\"\r\n* Quiet cul-de-sac position\r\n* Positioned in a street with an established track record of development\r\n* Zoned for Pinehill School, Murrays Bay Intermediate, Northcross Intermediate, and Rangitoto College\r\n* Minutes to Browns Bay Village, Albany Mall, transport, and beaches\r\n\r\nThis pocket of Browns Bay has long been held tightly, a neighbourhood where families settle in, and stay. Quiet, connected, and close to it all. The kind of address where tomorrow's homes will be just as sought-after.\r\n\r\nThe location is established. The opportunity is rare. And after 25 years, our vendors are committed to selling. Now it's your move.\r\n\r\nWelcome Home.",
